<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1004].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1004&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;FRESHWATER MEDIUM FOR SOIL AOA</FONT></B></P>
<I>Basic FWM solution:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaCl                                                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl                                                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>                                             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                          </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Autoclave Basic FWM solution and aseptically add the following solutions (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized) in the given order: <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Modified trace element mixture (see below)               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin solution* (see below)                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 7.5 mM EDTA&#183;Na&#183;Fe(III) solution* (pH 7.0)    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1 M NaHCO<sub>3</sub> solution*                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> HEPES solution (see below)                              </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1 M NH<sub>4</sub>Cl solution                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1 M Sodium pyruvate solution*                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Use glass or polystyrene containers for cultivation.  Cultivate in the dark without shaking. <br>
<I>Modified trace element mixture:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> HCl (25%)                                              </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;12.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> H<sub>3</sub>BO<sub>3</sub>                                             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;30.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MnCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;4H<sub>2</sub>O                                 </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;100.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CoCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                 </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;190.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NiCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;24.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CuCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> ZnSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                 </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;144.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>MoO<sub>4</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;36.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                        </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;987.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
<I>Vitamin solution:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Biotin                                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;20.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Folic acid                                              </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;20.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Pyridoxine&#183;HCl                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;100.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Thiamine&#183;HCl                                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;50.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Riboflavin                                              </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;50.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Nicotinic acid                                          </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;50.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> DL-Calcium pantothenate                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;50.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin B<sub>1</sub><sub>2</sub>                                        </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> <I>p</I>-Aminobenzoic acid                             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;50.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Choline chloride                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                          </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Adjust pH to 7.0 with KOH.  <br>
<I>HEPES solution:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaOH                                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;12.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> HEPES (free acid)                                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;119.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Dissolve NaOH in 300 ml distilled water.  While stirring vigorously, slowly add HEPES until completely dissolved.  Fill up to 450 ml with distilled water.  If 1 ml of this solution is added to 100 ml of the medium (containing all additive but HEPES), pH should be around 7.6 at 30ºC.  Otherwise, adjust pH of the HEPES solution with 10 N NaOH or conc. HCl.  Finally fill up to 500 ml with distilled water. <br>
 <br>
[Note] <br>
Adjust pH to 7.0 for JCM 31640.       <br>
